</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<xsd:documentation>Clear the prepaid or billable option for the line when Deferred Project Cost Accounting is configured. Only 1 of these options can apply to the supplier invoice line.</xsd:documentation>
<wd:Validation_Message>Clear the prepaid or billable option for the line when Deferred Project Cost Accounting is configured. Only 1 of these options can apply to the supplier invoice line.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>You can’t set a supplier invoice line as billable and add an item or spend category with asset tracking. Either clear the Billable check box on the supplier invoice line or remove these items or spend categories: [items].</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>You can’t set a supplier invoice line as billable and add an item or spend category with asset tracking. Either clear the Billable check box on the supplier invoice line or remove these items or spend categories: [items].</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>You can’t set a supplier invoice line as billable and add an item or spend category with inventory tracking. Either clear the Billable check box on the supplier invoice line or remove these items or spend categories: [items].</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>You can’t set a supplier invoice line as billable and add an item or spend category with inventory tracking. Either clear the Billable check box on the supplier invoice line or remove these items or spend categories: [items].</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>You can’t set transactions as billable and add billable capital project worktags. Clear the Billable check box on the transaction lines or remove these worktags: [worktags].</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>You can’t set transactions as billable and add billable capital project worktags. Clear the Billable check box on the transaction lines or remove these worktags: [worktags].</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
</xsd:appinfo>
</xsd:annotation>
</xsd:element>
<xsd:element name="Worktag_Split_Template_Reference" type="wd:Worktag_Split_TemplateObjectType" minOccurs="0">
