</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>Project based services aren't supported on Bill Only Purchase Orders.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>Make sure Enable Healthcare Options in Tenant Setup - Financials is selected and the designated Purchase Order Type supports Procedure Information.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>Prepaid and Retention fields aren't supported on Bill Only Purchase Orders.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>You can’t consolidate requisition lines with other Bill Only Requisitions marked for Procedure Information.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>You can’t enter prepaid or retention options on consignment purchase orders.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>You can't edit a [PO Type] purchase order through the purchase order webservice</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>You can’t enter service lines on consignment purchase orders.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>You can’t enter project-based services on consignment purchase orders.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>You can't create a [PO Type] purchase order through the purchase order webservice.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<xsd:documentation>You can't specify a third party tax code in the transaction tax code reference.</xsd:documentation>
<wd:Validation_Message>You can't specify a third party tax code in the transaction tax code reference.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>You selected an invalid supplier contract for this purchase order. Select a supplier contract that's valid for the company, supplier, and document date; not undergoing an amendment; and supports manual purchase orders.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<xsd:documentation>You can't create service and project-based lines for External Warehouse type purchase orders.</xsd:documentation>
<wd:Validation_Message>You can't create service and project-based lines for External Warehouse type purchase orders.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<xsd:documentation>You can't create service and project-based lines for External Warehouse type purchase orders.</xsd:documentation>
<wd:Validation_Message>You can't create service and project-based lines for External Warehouse type purchase orders.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>Submit a total extended amount that's greater than or equal to zero. The sum of all lines can't be negative.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>You can't submit a purchase order with a purchase order type that is inactive.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<xsd:documentation>Select at least one line for a down payment if you enter a percent or down payment amount.</xsd:documentation>
