</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<xsd:documentation>If at least one line has down payment, you must enter a percent or an amount.</xsd:documentation>
<wd:Validation_Message>If at least one line has down payment, you must enter a percent or an amount.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<xsd:documentation>You can enter down payment terms for all purchase order types except Bill Only and Consignment.</xsd:documentation>
