</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<xsd:documentation>Enter a catalog item associated to a purchase item. Workday doesn't support catalog items that aren't associated to purchase items on consignment purchase orders.</xsd:documentation>
<wd:Validation_Message>Enter a catalog item associated to a purchase item. Workday doesn't support catalog items that aren't associated to purchase items on consignment purchase orders.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>For consigned replenishment lines on the Delivery Type field, you can enter Inventory Replenishment or Par Replenishment for stocked items and Par Replenishment for non-stocked items. You can also leave the Delivery Type field blank and Workday populates an appropriate value.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>Delivery Type can be entered only for the Goods Line with Inventory Spend Category</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>For stocked items, enter a Deliver-To Location that's an inventory site or stocking location setup for consigned goods.For non-stocked items, enter a Deliver-To Location that is a valid par location for the company.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>Enter the valid spend category '[valid category]' or leave the spend category field blank. This spend category is invalid for goods item '[Goods Item]': '[Invalid Spend Category]'.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<xsd:documentation>Enter only stocked items on External Warehouse type purchase orders.</xsd:documentation>
<wd:Validation_Message>Enter only stocked items on External Warehouse type purchase orders.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<xsd:documentation>Remove lines with ad hoc noncatalog items. You can't enter ad hoc noncatalog items on External Warehouse type purchase orders.</xsd:documentation>
<wd:Validation_Message>Remove lines with ad hoc noncatalog items. You can't enter ad hoc noncatalog items on External Warehouse type purchase orders.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<xsd:documentation>Leave the Delivery Type field blank. You can't enter a Delivery Type for External Warehouse type purchase orders.</xsd:documentation>
