</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>Remove the splits from the lines. You can't split goods lines with a unit cost of zero.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>Enter a unit cost that's greater than or equal to zero. You can't enter values less than zero for consignment-type purchase orders.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>Submit a valid commodity code or leave the commodity code field blank.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>Submit a valid commodity code or leave the commodity code field blank. This commodity code isn't set up for the item ‘[Procurement Item]‘: ‘[Invalid Commodity Code]’</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<xsd:documentation>Inventory Replenishment is not a valid delivery type if either the header or line company is enabled for Alternate Ledger Currency</xsd:documentation>
<wd:Validation_Message>Inventory Replenishment is not a valid delivery type if either the header or line company is enabled for Alternate Ledger Currency</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>The Company on the Requisition Line Reference for this Purchase Order Line must be a valid company for the Purchase Order.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
