<wd:Validation_Message>Supplier Contract must have a Supplier Contract Type that allows Manual POs, Manual Invoices and Supplier Catalogs to use this web service task. If you need to update a Supplier Contract with a different Supplier Contract Type, please use the new Submit Supplier Contract web service task.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
</xsd:appinfo>
</xsd:annotation>
<xsd:sequence>
