<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>You can't consolidate requisitions that support Procedure Information.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>For Bill Only Requisitions, set Exclude Ship-To Address to TRUE when consolidating requisition lines.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>You can't edit a [Requisition Type] requisition through the requisition webservice.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>You can't create a [Requisition Type] requisition through the requisition webservice.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>Cannot specify a Ship To Address at the same time as Ad Hoc Address data. Either specify a Ship To Address or specify Ad Hoc Address data, but not both.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>Ship To Address is required. The Ship To Address is required unless you are creating an Ad Hoc Address for the requisition.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>Submit a requester for this requisition.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>Submit a reference ID for an external system that supports requisitions in the External System.</wd:Validation_Message>
