</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<xsd:documentation>Component assets used to create a composite asset must be trackable.</xsd:documentation>
<wd:Validation_Message>Component assets used to create a composite asset must be trackable.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<xsd:documentation>Component assets used to create a composite asset must have a status of "Registered" or if discrete lifecycles option is selected, statuses of In Service, Issued and Out of Service are allowed.</xsd:documentation>
