<wd:Validation>
<xsd:documentation>The quantity selected must be equal to the total approved quantity and the total available quantity must be equal to the total approved quantity when Discrete Component Lifecycles is selected.</xsd:documentation>
<wd:Validation_Message>The quantity selected must be equal to the total approved quantity and the total available quantity must be equal to the total approved quantity when Discrete Component Lifecycles is selected.</wd:Validation_Message>
