<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>Leave Item Inventory Attribute Reference blank. You can't submit Item Inventory Attribute Reference values when the purchase item isn't assigned this Item Inventory Attribute or when creating a new purchase item.</wd:Validation_Message>
