<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>You can't enter more than 1 of the same supplier without linking to a catalog item per purchase item.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>Enter a Supplier Item Identifier that isn't already in use by a catalog item in the same catalog.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>Select different Supplier Contracts on the Supplier Information tab or update the contracts already selected. You can’t have multiple contracts for the same company with an overlapping date range.</wd:Validation_Message>
