<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>[TDL][[[TaxRate]] - Specify a tax amount for the line tax rate that is equal to the sum of the recoverable and nonrecoverable amounts.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>[TDL][[[TaxRate]] - When recoverability is fully recoverable, specify 0 for the nonrecoverable amount.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
