<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>Reorder the templates or select different templates because the current setup is invalid. More valid template combinations are available when you select only the Search and Select check box. Note: When you select a primary template with only supplier item information or only item inventory site attributes, you can’t select enrichment templates with purchase item information. A template with purchase item information must come before an enrichment template with inventory site attributes.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>You can't have more than one worksheet template definition for the purchase item request type containing Alternate Item Identifiers with valid values.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
</xsd:appinfo>
</xsd:annotation>
