</xsd:annotation>
</xsd:element>
<xsd:element name="Recurring_Daily_Charge" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="1">
<xsd:annotation>
<xsd:documentation>This boolean is used in the Recurring Daily Charge field in the Itemization Mapping table. If true, the expense item is treated as a Recurring Daily Charge. If false, the expense item is treated as a Charge Breakdown.</xsd:documentation>
</xsd:annotation>
</xsd:element>
<xsd:element name="Required" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="1">
<xsd:annotation>
<xsd:documentation>If true. the selected expense item is required on the Itemization Line for Expense Report.</xsd:documentation>
</xsd:annotation>
</xsd:element>
<xsd:element name="is_Room_Rate" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="1">
<xsd:annotation>
<xsd:documentation>If true, the selected expense item is treated as a room rate charge.</xsd:documentation>
</xsd:annotation>
</xsd:element>
<xsd:element name="Always_Generate_Itemization_Line" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="1">
<xsd:annotation>
<xsd:documentation>If true, an itemization line with the specified expense item is generated on a Summary Expense Report Line. If CCT data is enabled, it's used to create and populate the itemization line. If CCT data is not enabled, an empty template line is created with basic information only.</xsd:documentation>
</xsd:annotation>
</xsd:element>
<xsd:element name="Product_Code_Reference" type="wd:Level_3_Product_CodeObjectType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded">
<xsd:annotation>
<xsd:documentation>Used in the Select Level 3 Product Code for Expense Item Configuration field in the Itemization Mapping table.</xsd:documentation>
</xsd:annotation>
</xsd:element>
</xsd:sequence>
</xsd:complexType>
<xsd:complexType name="Itemization_Configuration_Mapping_DataType">
<xsd:annotation>
<xsd:documentation>Element contains all Itemization Configuration Mapping Data.</xsd:documentation>
<xsd:appinfo>
<wd:Validation>
<xsd:documentation>You can set the room rate only once on the itemization mapping.</xsd:documentation>
<wd:Validation_Message>You can set the room rate only once on the itemization mapping.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<xsd:documentation>You can set each product code only once on the itemization mapping.</xsd:documentation>
<wd:Validation_Message>You can set each product code only once on the itemization mapping.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<xsd:documentation>You can use each expense item only once to configure itemization mapping.</xsd:documentation>
<wd:Validation_Message>You can use each expense item only once to configure itemization mapping.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<xsd:documentation>To select Always Generate Itemization Line, or Product Code Reference, you must first set Automatically Populate Itemization from Credit Card Transaction Data to true.</xsd:documentation>
<wd:Validation_Message>To select Always Generate Itemization Line, or Product Code Reference, you must first set Automatically Populate Itemization from Credit Card Transaction Data to true.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<xsd:documentation>To select Automatically Populate Itemization from Credit Card Transaction Data, or is Room Rate, you must first set Hotel Expense to true.</xsd:documentation>
<wd:Validation_Message>To select Automatically Populate Itemization from Credit Card Transaction Data, or is Room Rate, you must first set Hotel Expense to true.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<xsd:documentation>You can’t set Hide Itemization to true if itemization mappings exist.</xsd:documentation>
<wd:Validation_Message>You can’t set Hide Itemization to true if itemization mappings exist.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<xsd:documentation>You can't set both Hotel Itemization and Hide Itemization to true on an expense item.</xsd:documentation>
<wd:Validation_Message>You can't set both Hotel Itemization and Hide Itemization to true on an expense item.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation>
<wd:Validation_Message>When you use level 3 credit card transaction data, you need to select the Always Generate Itemization Line check box on at least 1 expense report line.</wd:Validation_Message>
</wd:Validation>
</xsd:appinfo>
